msgid "Open Google Cloud Console and pick (or create) a project."
msgstr "Откройте Google Cloud Console и выберите (или создайте) проект."

#: includes/Auth/SocialLogin.php:130
msgid ""
"Go to \"APIs & Services\" → \"OAuth consent screen\" and fill in your app "
"name and support email."
msgstr ""
"Перейдите на \"APIs & Services\" → \"OAuth consent screen\" и заполните имя "
"вашего приложения и вспомогательный адрес электронной почты."

#: includes/Auth/SocialLogin.php:131
msgid ""
"Go to \"Credentials\" → \"Create credentials\" → \"OAuth client ID\" → "
"choose \"Web application\"."
msgstr ""
"Перейдите на \"Credentials\" → \"Create credentials\" → \"OAuth client ID\" "
"→ выберите \"Web application\"."

#: includes/Auth/SocialLogin.php:132
msgid ""
"Under \"Authorized redirect URIs\" paste the redirect URI shown below, then "
"click Create."
msgstr ""
"В разделе \"Authorized redirect URIs\" вставьте URI перенаправления, "
"показанный ниже, затем нажмите Create."

#: includes/Auth/SocialLogin.php:133
msgid "Copy the Client ID and Client secret it shows you and paste them here."
msgstr ""
"Скопируйте Client ID и Client Secret, которые показаны, и вставьте их здесь."

#: includes/Auth/SocialLogin.php:156
msgid ""
"Open Facebook for Developers and click \"Create App\" (choose the "
"\"Authenticate and request data from users\" use case)."
msgstr ""
"Откройте Facebook для разработчиков и нажмите \"Create App\" (выберите "
"вариант использования \"Authenticate and request data from users\")."

#: includes/Auth/SocialLogin.php:157
msgid "In the app, add the \"Facebook Login\" product."
msgstr "В приложении добавьте продукт \"Facebook Login\"."

#: includes/Auth/SocialLogin.php:158
msgid ""
"Under Facebook Login → Settings, paste the redirect URI shown below into "
"\"Valid OAuth Redirect URIs\"."
msgstr ""
"В разделе Facebook Login → Settings вставьте URI перенаправления, показанный "
"ниже, в \"Valid OAuth Redirect URIs\"."

#: includes/Auth/SocialLogin.php:159
msgid ""
"Open Settings → Basic and copy the \"App ID\" (Client ID) and \"App Secret\" "
"(Client Secret) here."
msgstr ""
"Откройте Settings → Basic и скопируйте здесь \"App ID\" (Client ID) и \"App "
"Secret\" (Client Secret)."

#: includes/Auth/SocialLogin.php:160
msgid "Switch the app to \"Live\" mode so anyone can sign in."
msgstr "Переведите приложение в режим \"Live\", чтобы каждый мог войти."

#: includes/Auth/SocialLogin.php:179
msgid ""
"Open GitHub → Settings → Developer settings → \"OAuth Apps\" → \"New OAuth "
"App\"."
msgstr ""
"Откройте GitHub → Settings → Developer settings → \"OAuth Apps\" → \"New "
"OAuth App\"."

#: includes/Auth/SocialLogin.php:180
msgid "Set the \"Authorization callback URL\" to the redirect URI shown below."
msgstr ""
"Установите \"Authorization callback URL\" на URI перенаправления, показанный "
"ниже."

#: includes/Auth/SocialLogin.php:181
msgid "Click \"Register application\"."
msgstr "Нажмите \"Register application\"."

#: includes/Auth/SocialLogin.php:182
msgid ""
"Copy the \"Client ID\", then click \"Generate a new client secret\" and copy "
"that too."
msgstr ""
"Скопируйте \"Client ID\", затем нажмите \"Generate a new client secret\" и "
"скопируйте это также."

#: includes/Auth/SocialLogin.php:201
msgid "Open the Discord Developer Portal and click \"New Application\"."
msgstr "Откройте портал разработчиков Discord и нажмите \"New Application\"."

#: includes/Auth/SocialLogin.php:202
msgid ""
"Open the \"OAuth2\" tab and copy the \"Client ID\" and \"Client Secret\" "
"here."
msgstr ""
"Откройте вкладку \"OAuth2\" и скопируйте здесь \"Client ID\" и \"Client "
"Secret\"."

#: includes/Auth/SocialLogin.php:203
msgid ""
"Still on OAuth2, under \"Redirects\", add the redirect URI shown below and "
"save."
msgstr ""
"Все еще на OAuth2, в разделе \"Redirects\" добавьте показанный ниже URI "
"перенаправления и сохраните."

